            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.11.13+DEU.11.14+DEU.11.15+DEU.11.16+DEU.11.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 11:13–17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa achienderera kugomba achiamba, “Mchiphundza shariya hizi na kuzigbwira, Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, andagbwira chilaganeche namwi na kukuonyesani mendzwaye isiyosika dza vira arivyolaga akare enu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andakumendzani na kukujaliyani namwi mundaenjerezeka na kukala na uvyazi. Andabariki minda yenu kusudi mphahe mtsere, uchi wa zabibu na mafuha. Andakubarikini kpwa kukuphani ngʼombe na vyaa vinji vya mangʼondzi kpwenye tsi ariyoalaga akare enu kukala andakuphani mwimwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaajaliwa kuriko atu anjina osi duniani. Kahi yenu takundakala mlume wala mchetu mgumba wala mifugo yenu taindakala tasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu andakuusirani makongo gosi na tamundaphahwa ni makongo mai mrigogamanya ko Misiri, ela andaapha makongo higo hinyo anaokumenani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olagani atu osi ambao Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu andaatiya mwenu mikononi. Msiaonere mbazi wala kuabudu milungu yao, mana dzambo hiri rindakala muhego kpwenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mendzerepho munaamba hivi mwenu mioyoni, ‘Atu hinya ni anji kuriko swiswi, hunawezadze kuazola kula kpwenye tsi yao?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msiaogophe, ela tambukirani vira Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, arivyomuhenda mfalume wa Misiri na tsi ndzima ya Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tambukirani majaribu makulu mrigoona na matso genu, ishara na maajabu na uwezo mkpwulu wa kuterya, ambao Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu wahumira kukukombolani, hivyo ndivyo ndivyoahendera atu munaoaogopha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaidi ya higo, Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, andahuma nyuchi kahi yao hadi hara ndiosala achidzifwitsa aolagbwe tsetsetse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, msiaogophe, kpwa sababu Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, a kahi yenu. Iye ni Mlungu mkpwulu na wa kutisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, andazola atu a mataifa higa achache-achache mbere zenu kadiri munavyosengera mbere. Mwenyezi Mlungu kandakuruhusuni kugaolaga gosi mara mwenga, kpwa sababu muchihenda hivyo isabu ya nyama a tsakani indazidi na kukala dzambo ra hatari kpwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, andagatiya maadui genu mwenu mikononi na kugahenda gaangaike sana hadi gafwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andatiya afalume aho mwenu mikononi, namwi mundaaolaga tsetsetse nao taandatambukirwa tsona duniani. Taphana mutu yeyesi ndiyeweza kukuzuwiyani, hadi ndiphoaangamiza osi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochani milungu yao ya vizuka. Msiaze feza wala zahabu zovwikpwa milungu yao, wala msizihale mkazihenda zenu. Kuhenda hivyo ni muhego kpwenu na ni dzambo rinaromtsukiza Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usitiye mwako nyumbani chitu cha kutsukiza Mlungu, sedze ukatengbwa kpwa ajili ya kuangamizwa dza chitu hicho. Vimeneni na kuvibera kpwa sababu ni vitu virivyotengbwa ili viangamizwe tsetsetse.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
